WEBVTT

00:00:28.323 --> 00:00:31.301
Our team has scoured humanity's wisdom

00:00:31.325 --> 00:00:37.317
for solutions to draw down
heat-trapping, climate-changing emissions

00:00:37.341 --> 00:00:39.103
in the atmosphere --

00:00:39.127 --> 00:00:43.212
not "someday, maybe,
if we're lucky" solutions,

00:00:43.236 --> 00:00:46.770
the 80 best practices and technologies

00:00:46.794 --> 00:00:48.849
already in hand:

00:00:48.873 --> 00:00:53.819
clean, renewable energy,
including solar and wind;

00:00:54.609 --> 00:00:58.486
green buildings, both new and retrofitted;

00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:03.244
efficient transportation
from Brazil to China;